  concept: 'Authored objective: Commission the MCU and memory.

    Authored requirement:
    Verify all three rails, clock/reset, a qualified SPI flash image and RAM readback.

    General
    teaching principle: Memory and initialization workflows require checking power,
    connectivity, configuration and the authored test responses in the correct sequence.

    Only
    fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete.'
